# South taps A; a second tap inside the window makes it B instead (decided once the window ends).
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Gestures
tap south 30
advance 400
tap south 30
advance 100
tap south 30
advance 400
---
key KEY_A down @280
key KEY_A up   @280
key KEY_B down @560
key KEY_B up   @590
